  "construction": "Mixed-orbit Z6-invariant non-CSS stabilizer code: 23 qubits partitioned into five Z6-orbits of sizes [6, 6, 6, 3, 2] (indices 0..5, 6..11, 12..17, 18..20, 21..22; Z6 acts cyclically modulo each orbit size) and 18 independent generators (3 orbits of 6) generated by shifting X0 X2 Y8 Z15 Y18 Z21, Y4 Z5 Z12 X17 Z19 X22, and Z0 Y2 Z6 Z7 X10 Y14. All 18 checks have weight 6. Found by incremental SAT search (CaDiCaL 1.9.5 via PySAT) with upfront distinct-syndrome constraints for weights 1-2 and orbit-deduplicated lazy cuts up to weight 4; single-layer 2D layout (r = 3.6059, min spacing >= 1.0001) optimized by simulated annealing and scale-invariant continuous ratio polishing. Not CSS under any single-qubit Clifford.",
  "origin": "submission",
