  ],
  "novelty": "unknown",
  "notes": "Distance: exhaustive enumeration over all Pauli operators of weights 1-4 finds zero nontrivial logicals, and an independent HiGHS MILP over all 10 logical sectors certifies d = 5 exactly (stored weight-5 witness: Z2 Y7 Z8 X10 Z15). Minimum non-identity stabilizer weight across all 262,143 elements is 6. Filed with confidence upper_bound because the board's server certifier does not yet minimize non-CSS Pauli weight. Not CSS under any single-qubit Clifford (checked by verify/qldpc_verify.py). Literature novelty is not claimed.",
